  "description": "\"Fragile Love\" is the second yuri themed visual novel produced and distributed by XuWuLe\n\n• Story-\nThis is a story about promises and redemption.\nThey were childhood inseparable playmates, but when we said goodbye, they were strangers\nThey don't like each other, but they also attract each other,\nThey are incompatible opponents of fire and water, and they are a perfect match for lovers.\n• Characters-\n\n• About-\n着重描写女性之间的微妙细腻感情；纯爱题材，唯一cp，结局的好坏取决于恋爱中的细枝末节；全人物全程配音，体验声入人心的真情对白；\n\n• Staff-\n【制作】xuwule【企划】xuwule【剧本】selto【立绘，cg】大雾【背景】诗歌，jancycoco【配音】梧枝枝，米糊，沐月幺【ui】xuwule【pv】xuwule\n特别感谢：woctordho 鹰仓白霞",
